<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - A.H. Belo restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - A.H. Belo restarted.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it resumed coverage of A.H. Belo Corp as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Said 12- to 18-month price target is about $45 to $47 a share.</p>
<p>-- Expects Belo to earn $1.15 a share in 1997 and $1.40 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Said after-tax cash flow per share estimates are $3.58 for 1997 and $3.85 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Belo gained 1/4 to 38-1/2.</p>
</text>
